Error [E0205]: can't change `n` through a shared `self` receiver
  --> tests/ui/self_field_assign_not_mut.jet:5:14
    |
  5 |         self.n = self.n + 1
    |              ^
 Why: while something is being changed in place, the place that owns it must be changeable
 Fix: write the receiver as `mut self` so the method may change it
